    "wl_image_text_cta_za6tW4": {
      "type": "wl-image-text-cta",
      "blocks": {
        "image_ipYjV6": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cbg-and-cbd.png",
            "bkg_color": "#595378",
            "font_color": "#ffffff",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "You Deserve the Best: CBD Softgel Capsules",
            "content": "<p>If you’ve taken a moment to visit our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/blogs/blog\">cannabis and hemp blog</a>, you probably know that CBD is a cannabinoid, members of a family of natural compounds that have been shown to impart some truly exciting potential medical benefits. Like its cousins THC and <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/delta-8\">Delta-8 THC</a>, CBD interfaces with our bodies through a vital and complex regulatory network called the endocannabinoid system (ECS). Increasingly recognized as one of our body’s crucial systems, the ECS helps control such functions as sleep, memory, immune health, and more.</p><p>CBD is often associated with a mild cerebral lift. Over and above this, CBD has been shown to help us <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4604171/\">manage stress</a> and tackle <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7023045/#:~:text=Clinical%20studies%20have%20confirmed%20that,of%20immune%20cells%20%5B66%5D.\">minor aches and strains</a>.<br/><br/>Want to go deeper? We invite you to learn more about the ECS and its function<a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/blogs/blog/what-is-the-endocannabinoid-system\">here</a>.<br/><br/></p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_Cam9hg": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_17_2026_03_44_04_PM.png",
            "bkg_color": "#ffd700",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "HempLucid’s Full-Spectrum CBD",
            "content": "<p>Whether you prefer <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/cbd-tinctures\">CBD oil</a>, <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/edible-cbd\">CBD gummies</a>, or our flagship <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/water-soluble-cbd\">water soluble CBD </a>line, there’s no end of formats by which to access these game-changing cannabinoids.</p><p>So, why choose CBD softgel capsules?<br/><br/>At HempLucid, we saw a need for a convenient and shelf-stable version of our cannabinoid products, whether in capsule form or as <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/hemp-gummies-for-sleep\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">cbn gummies</span></a> for nighttime support.</p><p>For those of us who prefer an intuitive and easy-to-dose format with no hempy aftertaste, our CBD capsules are the perfect tool for the job. Full-spectrum cannabinoids are what make hemp extract the <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/blogs/blog/best-cbd-oil-for-pain\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">best CBD oil for pain relief</span></a>, and our capsules deliver them in a precise, pre-measured dose.<br/><br/>We’re committed to creating the purest, highest cannabinoid products available. Our medicinal hemp strain is grown to USDA organic standards from clones cultivated and proven over the past decade, and we’re incredibly proud to have maintained USDA Organic Handler’s certification since 2020.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_GP3xtF": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/plant-powered-focus-blend.png",
            "bkg_color": "#bcd868",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "Plant-Powered^ Proprietary Focus Blend",
            "content": "<p>Here at HempLucid, we think life is <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/pages/about\" target=\"_blank\">BETTER WITHOUT CHEMICALS AND SYNTHETIC DRUGS</a> in our systems. That’s a major reason our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/products/functional-gummies-focus-cbg-mushroom\" target=\"_blank\">MUSHROOM FOCUS GUMMIES</a> rely on Lion’s Mane, CBD and CBG, and brain-boosting botanicals such as green coffee beans, L-Tyrosine, and L-Theanine, two amino acids that are supportive of brain function and relaxation. Taken in conjunction, this “power trio” has been shown to have <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6880365/\" target=\"_blank\">BRAIN-BOOSTING BENEFITS</a>. </p><p><br/>In addition to being convenient (and just plain delicious), our Focus Gummies are formulated to be highly bioavailable. In essence, this means that an especially high percentage of their functional compounds make it into the bloodstream to have the most impact and effect. That’s one reason many people experience positive effects with just half a gummy a day. That said, because of the robust safety profiles of all ingredients, it’s perfectly safe to take up to two Focus Gummies a day for maximum support.<br/><br/></p>",
            "cta_text": "Read More",
            "cta_link": "#"
          }
        }
      },
